HTTP Method Route Description Role Required Request Body Expected Response
POST /api/auth/register Register new user account None { email, password, firstName, lastName, role } 201 Created - user details; 400 Bad Request - validation errors; 409 Conflict - email exists
POST /api/auth/login Authenticate user and return JWT None { email, password } 200 OK - { token, user }; 401 Unauthorized - invalid credentials
GET /api/auth/me Get current user profile Any (logged in) None 200 OK - user profile; 401 Unauthorized - not logged in
PUT /api/auth/me Update current user profile Any (logged in) { firstName, lastName, ... } 200 OK - updated profile; 400 Bad Request - validation errors
GET /api/events Get all events (with filters) Any None (query params: status, date, type) 200 OK - list of events
GET /api/events/{id} Get event by ID Any None 200 OK - event details; 404 Not Found - event doesn't exist
POST /api/events Create new event Organiser { name, description, date, location, ... } 201 Created - event; 400 Bad Request - validation errors; 401 Unauthorized - not organiser
PUT /api/events/{id} Update event Organiser { name, description, ... } 200 OK - updated event; 404 Not Found; 403 Forbidden - not event owner
DELETE /api/events/{id} Delete event Organiser None 204 No Content; 404 Not Found; 403 Forbidden
GET /api/events/{id}/categories Get all categories for event Any None 200 OK - list of categories
POST /api/events/{id}/categories Add category to event Organiser { categoryName, distance, entryFee, ... } 201 Created - category; 400 Bad Request; 404 Not Found
PUT /api/categories/{id} Update category Organiser { categoryName, distance, ... } 200 OK - updated category; 404 Not Found
DELETE /api/categories/{id} Delete category Organiser None 204 No Content; 404 Not Found
GET /api/enrolments Get all enrolments (filter by participant) Participant None (query: eventId, status) 200 OK - list of enrolments
POST /api/events/{id}/enrol Enrol in event category Participant { categoryId } 201 Created - enrolment; 400 Bad Request; 409 Conflict - already enrolled
PUT /api/enrolments/{id}/cancel Cancel enrolment Participant None 200 OK - cancelled enrolment; 404 Not Found; 403 Forbidden - not participant's enrolment
PUT /api/enrolments/{id}/status Update enrolment status Organiser { status } 200 OK - updated enrolment; 404 Not Found
GET /api/results Get results (filter by event) Any None (query: eventId, participantId) 200 OK - list of results
POST /api/results Submit participant result Organiser { enrolmentId, finishTime, position } 201 Created - result; 400 Bad Request; 404 Not Found
PUT /api/results/{id} Update result Organiser { finishTime, position } 200 OK - updated result; 404 Not Found
GET /api/participants/{id}/results Get participant's result history Participant None 200 OK - list of participant results; 403 Forbidden - not own results
GET /api/weather/event/{id} Get weather for event Any None 200 OK - weather data; 404 Not Found
POST /api/weather/event/{id} Add/update weather for event Organiser { forecastDate, temperature, ... } 201 Created - weather; 400 Bad Request
GET /api/organisers/{id}/events Get all events by organiser Organiser None 200 OK - list of organiser events; 403 Forbidden - not own events
